  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/品種] Appreciates some light afternoon shade in hot, humid climates.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 中 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or North-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
